        <title type="html"><![CDATA[docs(web-api): document asynchronous task queuing for selectionchange event]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45096</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45096"/>
        <updated>2026-08-13T06:38:13.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277478855?u=5a248ed5d07d09d5cb64d1fc67c0e7c569aadc92&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Summary</h3>
<p dir="auto">This PR clarifies the dispatch timing of the <code class="notranslate">selectionchange</code> event across <code class="notranslate">Document</code>, <code class="notranslate">HTMLInputElement</code>, and <code class="notranslate">HTMLTextAreaElement</code> documentation.</p>
<p dir="auto">Per section 3.3 of the <a href="https://w3c.github.io/selection-api/#scheduling-selectionchange-event" rel="nofollow">W3C Selection API specification</a>, <code class="notranslate">selectionchange</code> is scheduled asynchronously as a task in the user interaction task queue rather than fired synchronously when the selection changes. This behavior differs from many other input/UI events and means listeners fire on the next turn of the event loop rather than within the same call stack.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #45082.">Closes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5118367030" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45082" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45082/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45082">#45082</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Changes Made</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>Document <code class="notranslate">selectionchange</code> event</strong>: Added an explanatory note in the Description section describing asynchronous task scheduling.</li>
<li><strong>HTMLInputElement <code class="notranslate">selectionchange</code> event</strong>: Clarified that selection changes are dispatched asynchronously via the task queue.</li>
<li><strong>HTMLTextAreaElement <code class="notranslate">selectionchange</code> event</strong>: Updated to maintain consistency across text control docs.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Verification</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Ran Prettier formatting check across all modified pages.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Signed-off-by: Poorvith M P <a href="mailto:poorvith007@proton.me">poorvith007@proton.me</a></p>]]></content>
